{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854060/extras/06770bd069a4dc9e58811c0dc1a59701.avif?t=1754722009\" width=800 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >get to the top of the pinball machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left button for the left flipper, right for the right. Pull the plunger (that metal thing that launches the ball from the start). That\u2019s it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expecting more from a pinball machine?<br><br><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain the ball\u2019s momentum and time your flipper hits just right. Use the environment to your advantage and discover your own shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Warning: Sometimes a clever idea can backfire.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied levels, each with its own personality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new stage brings fresh challenges\u2014ride the wind, hit buttons, travel through gravity tunnels, smash meteors, and conquer arenas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A true paradise for speedrunners!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Before making any rash decisions, remember: the beginning is always a place you can return to.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive visual style:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machine clearly shows its age-chipped paint reveals once-hidden screws, and loose wires occasionally peek through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, none of that takes away from the handcrafted charm and craftsmanship FlippTech once poured into their machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(FlippTech is not responsible for any damage to your mental well-being, nor for any destruction caused while attempting to complete this product. Play responsibly.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854060?t=1754722009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854060/a6f3e77ccaa34d06b77cbc7da13b96dc81d65d6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754722009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854060/c94d1f01faf6f051e64eb75780c407262efdaa07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754722009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854060/c94d1f01faf6f051e64eb75780c407262efdaa07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754722009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3871240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854060/extras/06770bd069a4dc9e58811c0dc1a59701.avif?t=1754722009\" width=800 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >get to th